        "text": "theorem inverse_coefficient_smooth {k : ℕ} (B : ℝ → E →L[ℝ] E)\n    (hB : ContDiffOn ℝ k B I) (hinv : ∀ x ∈ I, (B x).IsInvertible) :\n    ContDiffOn ℝ k (fun x => (B x).inverse) I"
